            "displayAsButton": false,
            "buttonSize": "big",
            "goToSlideType": "specified",
            "invisible": false,
            "solution": ""
          },
          {
            "x": 2.23463687150838,
            "y": 13.245033112582783,
            "width": 92.73743016759778,
            "height": 86.09271523178808,
            "action": {
              "library": "H5P.AdvancedText 1.1",
              "params": {
                "text": "<p><strong>Early Life of Hadrian</strong><br>\nHadrian was born on January 24, 76 AD, in Italica, near modern Seville in Spain. Although he was born into a well-to-do family, Hadrian's early life wasn't very well-documented. His father was a senator and his cousin, Trajan, would later become Emperor. After his father's death, Trajan took care of Hadrian's education, ensuring he received training in military affairs and administration, which paved the way for his future role as emperor.</p>\n\n<p><strong>Rise to Power</strong><br>\nIn 117 AD, after the death of Emperor Trajan, Hadrian became the emperor of Rome. His succession was somewhat controversial as it was based on documents supposedly signed by Trajan on his deathbed, naming Hadrian as his heir. Hadrian's close relationship with his predecessor and his marriage to Trajan's grand-niece helped solidify his position as the new ruler of the Roman Empire.</p>\n\n<p><strong>Military Strategy</strong><br>\nUnlike Trajan, Hadrian did not seek to expand the Roman Empire through military conquest. Instead, he focused on consolidating and securing its borders. He is perhaps best known for building \"Hadrian's Wall\" in Britain, which marked the northern limit of the empire. This defense strategy demonstrated his understanding of the limits of military power and the need for stable frontiers.</p>\n"
              },
              "metadata": {
                "contentType": "Text",
                "license": "U",
                "title": "Unbenannt: Text",
                "defaultLanguage": "en"
              },
              "subContentId": "53bc5361-5ce5-43a9-a00f-57bbceee9cd0"
            },
            "alwaysDisplayComments": false,
            "backgroundOpacity": 0,
            "displayAsButton": false,
            "buttonSize": "big",
            "goToSlideType": "specified",
            "invisible": false,
            "solution": ""
          }
        ],
